SUMMARY:Exact Wormholes and Ernst-like Potentials in Einstein–Maxwell–Scalar Field Gravity
DESCRIPTION:In this talk\, I will present an Ernst-like formulation for stationary axisymmetric solutions in Einstein-Maxwell-Scalar Field gravity. The main idea is to encode the gravitational\, electromagnetic\, and scalar degrees of freedom into a set of potentials\, extending the standard Ernst formalism beyond the vacuum and Einstein-Maxwell sectors. I will first explain how this framework reproduces several \nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16920/
